# Live harness output. `sample.sh` writes a timestamped dump per run and `watch.sh` appends to
# samples/timeline.log continuously; both are working state, and the ones worth keeping get
# committed under a descriptive name instead (see samples/*-2026-08-08-*).
*.state.toml
samples/timeline.log
samples/2[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-1][0-9][0-3][0-9]T*.txt
